{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6248e34cdab1a02e","name":"Imperial Security Bureau","source":{"id":"source:reference-6248e34cdab1a02e","title":"Imperial Security Bureau","revision":19474,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:02:35Z","sha256":"3648611583a93b6db6b7e98cfd8db2f8047f417da6f27c473f1c56b1dda06cfc","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19474","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Imperial%20Security%20Bureau&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6248e34cdab1a02e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Emperor's advisors created the Imperial Security Bureau (ISB) as a direct competitor to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},". The ISB is staffed with New Order loyalists, a situation that results in less objective, though dedicated and enthusiastic, information gathering. The ISB performs a combination of secret police and intelligence duties. Its agents are equally at ease operating in public or clandestinely and are not afraid to identify themselves when necessary. ISB agents are perceived to be everywhere.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ISB operates from an enormous central office on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Center"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Center"},". It actively competes with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Intelligence","referenceId":"reference:2cefdd2f372982d1"}," to gather the best data, albeit with a loyalist slant. It has offices and officers scattered throughout the galaxy and can be found on every major world. In the three short years of the New Order, ISB has become a well-known and feared commodity.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["ISB Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Nonheroic Units"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["NAME\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHALLENGE LEVEL\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["IT-0 Interrogator Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/IT-0_Interrogator_Droid","referenceId":"reference:adef89e591c21b09"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 1\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["ISB Agent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ISB_Agent","referenceId":"reference:a9bf456dc2deed4b"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["T0-D Interrogation Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/T0-D_Interrogation_Droid","referenceId":"reference:70e3fafeea062d4a"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["CL 4\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["ISB Informant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/ISB_Informant","referenceId":"reference:b8d0c141b1d8bf